  <dashboards>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='01 The problem'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>THE PROBLEM&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>Ownly won Bengaluru on the restaurant side. Hyderabad is a different fight.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' type-v2='text' w='50000' x='0' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>WHY WE PICKED THIS PROBLEM&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Ownly charges restaurants no commission and customers no platform fee. In Bengaluru it reached 50,000+ (~10% share) daily orders within a year and is now copying that playbook into Hyderabad, where it is already live.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='14'>Problem statement: will Ownly&apos;s Bengaluru value proposition transfer to Gachibowli, and what do 20-35 year-old students and professionals there need before they switch and stay?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' type-v2='text' w='50000' x='50000' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>BENGALURU vs HYDERABAD&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Restaurants:  Bengaluru - 1,000+ threatened to quit Swiggy/Zomato and came to Ownly.  Hyderabad - no revolt.

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Pitch:  zero commission, flat Rs30 delivery, no fees - copied as-is.

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Customers:  81.2% pay a rival membership in Bengaluru (16 people); 82.5% in Gachibowli (40 people).

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>Aug 2025 pilot  &gt;  Mar 2026 citywide, ~20,000 restaurants  &gt;  Jul 2026 restaurant revolt  &gt;  Aug 2026 50,000+ orders/day  &gt;  Sep 2026 live in Gachibowli</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Evidence: R1, R2, C-Ben-Pay a, C-Gac-Pay a (Evidence page).</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{0D9A4018-DF01-9C0D-2432-5E9033FABE61}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='02 Hyderabad users'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>HYDERABAD USERS&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>Gachibowli orders on Swiggy and Zomato, and most people pay both.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' name='Order share' w='50000' x='0' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' type-v2='text' w='50000' x='50000' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>82.5%&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>pay Swiggy One or Zomato Gold (33 of 40)

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>47.5%&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>pay for both (19 of 40)&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>57.5%&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>use two or more apps (23 of 40)

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>38.9%&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>said the extra charges were too much (14 of 36)

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>Rs30&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>median saving needed to switch (33 people)

</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>40 people in the Gachibowli catchment, 80% students, 77.5% aged 20-24. Ownly has been live for weeks, so 0% of orders is a starting point.  Evidence: B1-B8.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{9B59801D-F962-3186-2F19-C89E6E492057}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='03 Our KPIs'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>OUR KPIS&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>We tracked a funnel and the four things that block it. People have heard of Ownly, but hardly anyone orders.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' name='City funnel' w='50000' x='0' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' name='Barrier KPIs' w='50000' x='50000' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Why these KPIs: the funnel shows whether the playbook is working; the barriers show what would stop it here. Bengaluru is 16 people - direction only. Rapido users were less aware of Ownly than non-users (8 of 24 vs 9 of 16).  Evidence: K1-K9.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{12EBF425-6E4C-2064-3C2B-338F834E5CEC}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='04 Marketing metrics'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>MARKETING METRICS&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>Ownly&apos;s saving is big enough for most people, until a rival membership or coupon is applied.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' name='Coverage' w='50000' x='0' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' type-v2='text' w='50000' x='50000' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>FORMULA-SHEET METRICS&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Unit (volume) share: 0% of 326 orders - a floor, Ownly is weeks old
</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Penetration share: 2 of 36 (5.6%)

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>NOT COMPUTABLE, AND WHY&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Retention, CLV, CAC, YoY growth, revenue share - need Ownly&apos;s own customer, spend and revenue data, or a prior period.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Coverage = person x basket pairs where Ownly&apos;s real saving is at least what that person said they need to switch.  Evidence: MM1-0, MM1-1, MM1-2, MM2.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{EA9E3F29-DA5A-8C7C-E6CF-A91FA1D61AE3}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='05 Analysis - market'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>ANALYSIS - MARKET&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>Ownly is cheaper on the menu, but it is the same restaurants, slower. Every price-led challenger before it failed.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' name='Price audit' w='33333' x='0' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' name='Fee load' w='33333' x='33333' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='33333' x='66666' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>8 of 9&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>Ownly restaurants in our audit are also on Swiggy or Zomato

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>+17 min&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>longer quoted wait (39 captures)

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>6 of 6&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>earlier price-led challengers failed or shrank; Foodpanda ~200,000 to ~5,000 orders a day

</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='14' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>&quot;There&apos;s no new use case being unlocked here.&quot; - Zomato founder, Jul 2026.  Ownly&apos;s saving comes from removing fees, not paying for discounts.  Evidence: A-*, R5, R7, R9.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{215B6611-4302-C5FD-8AEA-C198EEB70130}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='06 Analysis - customers'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>ANALYSIS - CUSTOMERS&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>People will trade speed and reliability for Rs30, but not their restaurants. In the fake door a missing place lost the order about half the time.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' name='Trade-offs' w='50000' x='0' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' name='Missing place' w='50000' x='50000' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>McNemar exact p = 1.5e-06. When choosing a restaurant, 62.5% said trust/loyalty and 12.5% said price. What gets people to TRY is price (8 of 23) and a refund promise (6 of 23).  Evidence: T1-T5, F3, F4.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{FE7BEC65-E918-6FC2-A12A-B668810EE422}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='07 Analysis - trust'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>ANALYSIS - TRUST&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>The problem gets louder the closer people get to a real order. People don&apos;t trust the price, or the order, to hold.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' name='Voice' w='50000' x='0' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' name='Offer reasons' w='50000' x='50000' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Share of posts mentioning a theme, not a failure rate. App reviews = 29 coded posts (small). 52.9% took cash now because they may not return or don&apos;t trust later offers; only 35.3% took Ownly Money. Interviews: people leave after repeated bad orders.  Evidence: V-*, F10, F11.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{67A32EE9-3A82-E485-F6E0-877861D7FC1C}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='08 Analysis - fake door'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>ANALYSIS - FAKE DOOR&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>The fake door showed what people will pay for: speed through Rapido and a small fee. Not another membership.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' name='Rapido Link' w='33333' x='0' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' name='Payment' w='33333' x='33333' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='33333' x='66666' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>11 of 34&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>worry the captain will drop a passenger first

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>8 of 14&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>who came in from Rapido&apos;s food tab placed an order

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='22'>4 of 16&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>who came from the after-ride ad did

</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='14' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>70 live fake-door sessions; no money changed hands. 45.5% paid for Rapido Link overall (20 of 44) while the survey said 92.5% would wait.  Evidence: F0-F9.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{5FD624B5-120A-476B-D0B6-F93A931ED79B}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='09 Propositions'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>PROPOSITIONS&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>Don&apos;t buy the first order. Earn the second one.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>KEEP   </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Zero commission; no platform, packaging or surge fees.  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Fees 4.8% of an Ownly bill vs 15.1%-27.4% on rivals.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b07800' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>ADAPT   </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Stop saying &apos;cheaper than Swiggy/Zomato&apos; - show people their own bill.  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>After a rival coupon the saving clears only 27.3% of cases.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b07800' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>ADAPT   </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Go deep on local restaurants people refuse to give up.  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Only 35% would give them up; a missing place lost 53.3% of fake-door orders.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#138a5f' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>ADD   </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Rapido Link: paid fast delivery, no passenger on board.  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>45.5% paid Rs15-49 for it. Replaces &apos;don&apos;t spend on speed&apos;.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#138a5f' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>ADD   </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Same-day refund cover as a Rs9-39 option.  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Refund failure is in 79.3% of app reviews.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#8a877f' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>DEPRIORITISE   </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Big first-order discounts, and a third membership.  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Only 25% would stay after the offer; 3 of 8 Ownly Plus choosers placed an order.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='12' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Watch two numbers monthly: second orders after the offer ends, and orders that go wrong. If second orders don&apos;t come, stop the discounts rather than doubling them.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{0A600844-1F3F-914D-C376-9C58CEC52A2A}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='10 UI recommendations'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>UI RECOMMENDATIONS&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>Three screens that put the findings into the app.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' type-v2='text' w='33333' x='0' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>1. HOME LEADS WITH RESTAURANTS&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Search your usual place first; &apos;Your regulars on Ownly&apos;. If a place is missing, ask for it - a missing place becomes an onboarding list, not a lost order.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='12' type-v2='text' w='33333' x='33333' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>2. SELL SPEED AS A CHOICE&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Standard 42 min free, or Rapido Link 25 min for a fee - &apos;No passenger on board. Tracking from pickup.&apos; answers the top worry on the option itself.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='33333' x='66666' y='15000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>3. SHOW THE BILL, NOT A COMPARISON
</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='13'>Every line visible, fees read Rs0, no &apos;cheaper than Swiggy&apos; claim a coupon can disprove. Order Protection: late, cold or wrong - full refund the same day.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='14' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Phone mock-ups of these three screens are on page 10 of the HTML version (Ownly_Hyderabad_Story.html).</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{166988F0-C382-8B24-4386-FF82398B1442}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='11 Evidence'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='640' maxwidth='1300' minheight='640' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='15000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2a78d6' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>EVIDENCE&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1a18' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='19'>Evidence: every number, how it was calculated, and whether the sample is big enough.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='71000' id='11' name='Evidence table' w='100000' x='0' y='15000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14000' id='12' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='86000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#5b5953' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>OK = 30+; Small = 10-29 (direction); Too small = under 10 (count only). 95% Wilson intervals. &apos;Not a sample&apos; = cited media/filings. Fake door: 25 test rows and 1 duplicate removed; home-screen A/B dropped (arm fixed per phone: 58 vs 12).</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{E46BCEA4-855B-550B-DF66-D71ACEB750A3}' />
    </dashboard>
